    <string name="app_version">App version</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_text">Your account details and password stay on this device; passwords are stored as salted hashes. When you place an order, your name, phone number, email, delivery address, order details and uploaded design files are sent securely to PrintXpress so the order can be printed and delivered. We don’t sell or share your information with third parties.</string>
    <string name="terms_text">Orders are confirmed after we review your design file. We print files as supplied, so please check them against our Design Guidelines before uploading. Pending orders can be cancelled; once printing starts they can’t. Prices are in Sri Lankan rupees (Rs.).</string>
