    <string-array name="faq_questions">
        <item>How do I place an order?</item>
        <item>Which payment methods do you accept?</item>
        <item>Which files can I upload?</item>
        <item>Can I cancel an order?</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="faq_answers">
        <item>Pick a product, upload your design, set the quantity and add it to your cart. Then choose delivery or pickup, select a payment method and place the order.</item>
        <item>Cash on delivery, card on delivery (Visa or MasterCard) and bank transfer. Online card payment isn’t available yet.</item>
        <item>PDF, AI, PSD, JPG, PNG and TIFF files up to 100 MB. See the Design Guidelines for colour mode, resolution and bleed.</item>
        <item>Yes, while the order is still Pending. Once printing has started it can’t be cancelled.</item>
    </string-array>

